    <item>
      <title>Contact</title>
      <link>https://mlemrecords.com/about/contact/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://mlemrecords.com/about/contact/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;talk&#34;&gt;Talk&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Got a question? Wanna talk to a person? Wanna release something?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Send a message to &lt;a href=&#34;https://indieweb.social/@mlemrecords&#34;&gt;@mlemrecords&lt;/a&gt; on indieweb.social.&#xA;Or send an electronic mail to &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:hi@mlemrecords.com&#34;&gt;hi@mlemrecords.com&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:support@mlemrecords.com&#34;&gt;support@mlemrecords.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;demos&#34;&gt;Demos&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;If you&amp;rsquo;re interested in releasing music and you&amp;rsquo;re a cool person, we&amp;rsquo;d love to help out! If you send us files, please send publicly accessible links that we can stream from and a short message about you and your intentions.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Hit us up at &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:demos@mlemrecords.com&#34;&gt;demos@mlemrecords.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
